Giorgi's 4925 and the frontend's 11 Oct ask: the owner's tap closes the
goal on their own thread as finished (the owner's „solved", row 147),
clears the plan's buttons, leaves questions still out to the existing
keep-or-close card (row 311) and marks the conversation done. 404 for a
thread not theirs, 409 no_open_goal when nothing is open or paused.
Above the subscription gate with stop. No new owner-facing text.

